    <PROGRAM_DESCRIPTION_LONG>Passwords is a secure, lightweight password manager that uses GNU Privacy Guard (GPG) for all encryption operations. Every secret is encrypted locally on your device using strong, open-standard cryptography. No data is uploaded, synced, or shared. The application follows a strict zero-knowledge model: only you hold the keys, and only you can decrypt your data.</PROGRAM_DESCRIPTION_LONG>
